    "reviews": "\u201cThe creator of HYPNOSIS REVERIES perfectly integrates imagination and new technology with VR media, takes root in modern cities, and deeply explores the social reality facing young people today. It is a rare reflection and expression in Chinese works.\u201d<br />\r\nSandbox Immersive Festival<br />\r\n",
